      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just not about \"starting over.\" that's what people say to feel better, but you can't just restart a life that's been spent. it feels more like a bad investment. i spent my youth, my energy, every cent i had to build this, and now it's just a crater. it feels like the math of my life just doesn't add up anymore. i'm just staring at a loss that can't be recovered.",
